idden=""> <div> <div> <a href="#"> </a> <a href="#"> </a> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 1 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 2 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 3 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 4 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 5 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 6 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 7 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 8 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 9 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 10 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <button type="button"> </button> <div> Image 11 of 11 </div> <a href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"> <p>View Original</p> </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div><div><h3><a href="#">1. Sony WH-CH730N </a></h3><span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></span></div><div>What Hi-Fi? Award winner. Amazing noise-cancelling bang for very little buck.</div><div><div><a href="#"><p>Our expert review:</p></a><span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></span></div><div><div><aside></aside></div></div></div><div><h4>Specifications</h4><div><div class="spec__entry"><span>Type: </span><span>Over-ears </span></div><div class="spec__entry"><span>Bluetooth version : </span><span>6.0</span></div><div class="spec__entry"><span>Noise cancelling : </span><span>Yes</span></div><div class="spec__entry"><span>Built-in mic and controls : </span><span>Yes</span></div><div class="spec__entry"><span>Waterproofing : </span><span>None </span></div><div class="spec__entry"><span>Battery life : </span><span>Up to 50 hours (ANC and BT off), 35 hours (ANC / BT on)</span></div><div class="spec__entry"><span>Weight : </span><span>207g</span></div></div></div><div><aside><div><div class="hawk-merchant-link-widget-main-container"><div>Today's Best Deals</div><div><div><a aria-label="View Sony WH-CH730N on Doordash" href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" role="link"><span> <span>$179.99</span></span> at Doordash</a><div>Black</div></div><div><a aria-label="View Sony WH-CH730N on Doordash" href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" role="link"><span> <span>$179.99</span></span> at Doordash</a><div>White</div></div><div><a aria-label="View Sony WH-CH730N on Amazon" href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" role="link"> Check Amazon</a></div><div><a aria-label="View Audio on Best Buy" href="#" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" role="link"> Check Best Buy</a></div></div></div></div></aside></div><div><h4>Reasons to buy</h4><div><span><span>+</span><div class="pros__entry">Clear, detailed and hugely entertaining presentation</div></span><span><span>+</span><div class="pros__entry">Quality, foldable build</div></span><span><span>+</span><div class="pros__entry">Outstanding battery life</div></span></div></div><div><h4>Reasons to avoid</h4><div><span><span>-</span><div class="cons__entry">Need a bit of tweaking to perform at their best</div></span><span><span>-</span><div class="cons__entry">Noise cancelling struggles with external human speech</div></span></div></div></div><p><a href="#">Sony</a>'s cheap wireless headphones are among the best around, and the same is true of its noise-cancelling models. The CH730N have just won an Award, much like their predecessors, the <a href="#">CH720N</a>. Now <em>that's</em> form.</p><p>While we loved the CH720N, we thought the build quality could do with a bit of a rethink. And Sony has listened: the basic earcups have undergone a redesign, becoming larger and more oval, and feeling much more satisfying to the touch. They fold too, which makes them much less likely to be damaged when thrown in a bag.</p><p>Yes, the buttons are still a little cheap-feeling, but they do the job. Crucially, these design changes keep the headphones comfortable to wear, and that's despite them being slightly heavier than their predecessors.</p><p>If you use the noise cancellation (and we would advise you do), you'll get 50 hours of use before needing a recharge, but turn it off and the battery life extends to 75 hours. For the money, the feature set is impressive, including <a href="#">Bluetooth Multipoint</a>, DSEE upscaling and <a href="#">Sony 360 Reality Audio</a> for a more engrossing listen.</p><p>While the noise cancellation can't match pricier pairs, it is very good for the money. And the voice calls are superb: "We get a firm sense of the headphones pushing voices to the fore, all while effectively minimising intrusive background noise as we conduct our testing next to a busy road," we wrote in our <a href="#">Sony WH-CH730N review</a>.</p><p>And as for sound quality? They take everything we loved about their predecessors, and refine it to superb effect. "The newer headphones are clearer, more natural-sounding and a little more full-bodied than before, offering a presentation that expertly rides the line between punch and precision," we noted.</p><p>True, they prioritise entertainment value over out-and-out insight, but at this price, that's to be expected. For noise cancellers on a budget, look no further.</p><p><strong>Read our full </strong><a href="#"><strong>Sony WH-CH730N review</strong></a></p><ul><li><a href="#">Back to the top ⤴</a></li></ul><a></a><h3 class="article-body__section"><span>Best in-ears</span></h3><div> <div> <span> Image 1 of 14 </span> </div> <div> <div> <a href="#" aria-label="Image 1 of 14"> </a> <a href="#" aria-label="Image 14 of 14"> </a> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <figure> <div> <div> </div> </div> <figcaption> <span> (Image credit: What Hi-Fi?) </span> </figcaption> </figure> </div> <button type="button"> </button> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <figure> <div> <div> </div> </div> <figcaption> <span> (Image credit: What Hi-Fi?) </span> </figcaption> </figure> </div> <button type="button"> </button> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <figure> <div> <div> </div> </div> <figcaption> <span> (Image credit: What Hi-Fi?) </span> </figcaption> </figure> </div> <button type="button"> </button> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <figure> <div> <div> </div> </div> <figcaption> <span> (Image credit: What Hi-Fi?) </span> </figcaption> </figure> </div> <button type="button"> </butt